            "review_text": "Bj L\nSurfers Paradise, Australia1220 contributions\n0\nBurger King with an amusing twist\nAug 2016 • Friends\nIts burger king so there isnt much I could say as this style of food is either you hate it or enjoy it.\n\nThey do burgers and fries and all the usual but an amusing twist which you can see by the photos already posted is that they do a happy hour with Beer\nwell in the humidity of the afternoon, this can be something a bit different and something to try. \n\nTypical Burger King place but the Happy hour is a novel idea\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 10, 2017",
